activity Submit Request
activity Review Request
activity Approve Request
activity Reject Request
activity Set Up Remote Access
activity Notify Employee
activity Revoke Remote Access
activity Monitor Performance
activity Update Payroll
activity Complete Survey
bind Submit Request: Request ID, Employee Name, Request Type
bind Complete Survey: Survey Score
Request ID: integer between 1 and 999999
Employee Name: John Smith, Jane Doe, Michael Brown, Emily Johnson, David Wilson
Request Type: Remote Work, Flexible Hours
Survey Score: float between 0.0 and 10.0
Init[Submit Request] | |
Absence[Reject Request] | |
Chain Precedence[Review Request, Submit Request] | | |0,24,h
Response[Submit Request, Review Request] | | |0,24,h
Exclusive Choice[Approve Request, Reject Request] | | |
Precedence[Set Up Remote Access, Approve Request] | | |
Chain Succession[Set Up Remote Access, Notify Employee] | | |
Alternate Response[Monitor Performance, Update Payroll] | | |0,48,h
Not Co-Existence[Set Up Remote Access, Revoke Remote Access] | | |
Chain Response[Notify Employee, Complete Survey] | | |0,72,h